{"parse": {"title": "12TH-25", "pageid": 127810, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-24\" title=\"12TH-24\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-25</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">25</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BD.AA.E4.B8.8E.E7.BD.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"罪与罚\">罪与罚</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 罪与罚</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Crime and Punishment</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>又<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>写<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>名<span class=\"color-value\"></span>字<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>弹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鼓<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鼓<span class=\"color-value\"></span>囊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>囊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>弹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>袋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11225</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>这杯是为了芝诺骑兵军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-529801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-529801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-529801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>敬骑兵军，敬飞行中队，敬别列格勒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高举的橡木酒杯相互碰撞，清澈的澄黄酒液乘着泡沫跳出杯盏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔法4号：</div><div>敬我们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>哦……这酒不像村里人自己酿的萨莫贡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔法4号：</div><div>更烈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>差远了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑兵一口气牛饮了整杯啤酒，豪爽地大笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>再来一杯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭笑着坐在欢庆的人群中，脸颊虽然已经挂上微醺的红色，但眼睛仍如鹰一般盯着营帐外塞契的大门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到看见狮鹫军团的士兵们三两结伴离开，她才啐了一口，提起飞行扫帚向外走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-531301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔法4号：</div><div>你要去哪儿，中队长？你可是庆功宴的主角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>拜托别这么叫我，太肉麻了。还是像以前一样，叫我红弩箭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我回城里给你们再取些酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529917.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-529917.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529917.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529917.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-529917.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529917.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-529917.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529917.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>哦——酒后飞行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>报警抓我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>引擎喷出橘色尾焰，仍被命名为红色38的新式飞行扫帚转眼间冲入了云层，消失在众人眼前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长疑惑地看着飞行器尾迹冲向别列格勒，才掀开门帘走进了营帐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>红弩箭中尉去哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>回别列格勒拿酒去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长掂了掂手中酒瓶的重量，陷入沉思。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_23.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_23\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_23\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_3_at_23.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_23.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_3_at_23.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_23.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_3_at_23.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_23.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你期望中的审判恐怕不会发生，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>凭什么这么笃定？你有自信永远不被送上基金会的审判庭？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>重塑之手和基金会的战争还很漫长，在结束之前，抓捕我的命令根本不会下达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪口向前顶了顶，撞在神秘学家的后脑上——不比钢铁坚硬，也不似棉花柔软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘学家与人类的骨结构无异，在子弹面前，这是一处致命的弱点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>芝诺害怕引起士气崩溃与外部质疑，于是装模作样地把我们的照片挂上纪功廊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>当然，现在谁都知道我没有身亡。但逼迫一个可能的第三方成为敌人，对基金会的战略没有任何好处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>威胁未能引起长者的恐慌，伊戈尔神情自若，平静地回应着身后压抑不住怒火的红弩箭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>而我在圣保罗所犯下的罪行，已经让基金会与芝诺的各个派别之间出现摆上台面的嫌隙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>嫌隙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这场由重塑之手推动的战争中，本应作为主要战力的芝诺被联合指挥部派往了遥远的东线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行女巫知道他是对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>如果由基金会主导对你的审判，那将被芝诺视作挑衅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忍不住斜眼望向天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几名被她安排了巡逻任务的飞行巫师正从别列格勒上方驶过，基金会灰白的制服让她们有如掠空的白鸽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>鸽子屋会出面的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>即便它的出面会导致基金会与芝诺之间的信任彻底破产？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>信任……破产？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>芝诺希望所有人遗忘组织在圣保罗受到的屈辱，基金会也不愿意自己在芝诺中安插眼线的事被端上台面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>鸽子屋一旦介入，组织间微妙的平衡就难以继续维持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>等等，你刚刚说的眼线，难道说那些在圣保罗被你“放弃”的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>有十名人类士兵，四名神秘学家拒绝同我们离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>其中三人是早已暴露在我们视野中的内应，余下的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔闭了闭眼，不再为自己辩驳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>他们曾是你的战友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>颤抖的手指微微拉动扳机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>与你并肩，与你的近卫团共进退，同喝最后一滴水，分食最后一口干粮的人们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>用任务把他们支走，打晕他们，给他们下药。你明明有无数种方式带着你信任的人偷偷离开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>——为什么杀害他们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苍老的呼吸没有因质问而变得更急促，只是更加沉重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>天使兄弟会的人在盯着我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>为了换取可控的未来，减少无意义的牺牲，这是必要的流血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你把他们当成了向重塑之手投诚的筹码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你必须为此付出代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这是我的罪孽，我不会否认或回避它。偿还的日子终究会到来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不过，在那之前，我还是能为司辰提供她需要的援助，如同在顿河的这一次。这只是一个开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，草原寂静得连风都沉了下来。只有年轻飞行员的呼吸愈发沉重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>该死的！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_3_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_3_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-3_3_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左轮手枪被她烦闷地扔开，疯长的野草将武器拢入怀中，在转轮中扎下了根。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你什么态度？说死就死？你的死代表不了任何东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>而且你带走的那些人又怎么办？你甚至还欠洛佩拉一个交代！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>该死，你说得没错，伊万。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这老头已经疯了，疯得该被送去小梅斯梅尔那儿狠狠电一电。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长从土坡后走了出来，显然从最开始就隐匿在了审判现场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他注视着伊戈尔，透过对方沧桑的眼睛寻找过去的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你确实是个疯子，伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>除了重塑之手，这世上哪儿还有敢同时跟芝诺与基金会叫板的神秘学家？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>而你现在也彻底得罪了重塑之手。你的新军团已经骑虎难下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔转向这位老友，态度自若，仿若深陷泥潭的人并不是自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>骑虎难下？不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我的军团会成为一匹翱翔于世界的狮鹫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我的孩子们会用利爪撕碎所有敌人，用羽翼庇护彼此，拉着方舟不断越过时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>收收你的雄心壮志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭啐了一声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>说得倒轻巧，那些罪可没办法一笔勾销。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>的确，没有任何方式能弥补他造成的流血。但也没有任何人能否定他在南极和别列格勒做的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>南极……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我听头儿提过，是你的副官帮助乌尔里希绕过了重塑之手的布防。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你暗示的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这是莫莉德尔自我意志下的选择，我并未阻拦她，但也不必将这份高光算在我身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>你这老头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这是最后一次机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭跨上扫帚，启动引擎前回头看向伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指了指在云层中穿梭的飞行巫师们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530216.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-530216.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530216.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530216.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-530216.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530216.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-530216.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530216.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我们会看着你——我会牢牢盯着你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔缓缓点头作为回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一股无名火卡在胸腔里难以释放，红弩箭从鼻腔里发出了“哼”的一声，把引擎转速拉到最大，发泄似地冲上了天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我们年轻的时候和她一模一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>不容许眼里有沙子，看不惯的东西就用自己的手去摆正，觉得是错误的就亲自去纠正。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但没有因此冒着生命危险独自行动过……噢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他眉上的疤痕随笑意动了动，眼中流露出怀念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你有过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我不知道人到了你这个岁数还会有所变化，伊戈尔。这种变化……也不是我认为理想的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>人和河流一样，一成不变的结果是腐烂。它要找到通往海洋的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔向河边走了两步，靴后的马刺在河滩软泥上划出笔直的线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>是你劝她把子弹退出来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你帮了我们一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长烦闷地抓了一把自己的头发，走到伊戈尔身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>有烟吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>戒了。99年之后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>事业有成、声名显赫的芝诺骑兵军军长薅了一把河边的草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你知道红柳树村一战后，现在骑兵军里有多少孩子想和你走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我找到了一块足够大的净土，这其中也有你和骑兵军的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我还不想成为芝诺和基金会的双重通缉犯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但你为我这个“通缉犯”说情了，你是怎么说服红弩箭中尉的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>用一颗子弹了结你，还是让你永远活在背负鲜血的痛苦里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你怎么能确定我不是一个冷血的，不会感受到痛苦的叛徒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>就像你说的，“暴雨”后，我们都变了很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529617.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-529617.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529617.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529617.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-529617.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529617.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-529617.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529617.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>遗书，老朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这是死亡的力量，它比任何吐真剂都来得强大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529617.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-529617.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529617.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529617.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-529617.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529617.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-529617.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529617.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>“我玷污了我们曾最引以为傲的荣耀。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-529616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>“莫莉，请告诉洛佩拉……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长执信的手边裂开一道漆黑的神秘术辉光，自黑暗而来的巨口叼住信纸，咀嚼着把信拖回了虚无中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔手中的罐子闪烁了一瞬，一只萤火虫悠悠坠落在瓶底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>认真的吗？让你老态龙钟的身体变得更脆弱，只为了保护这点隐私？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>哈，隐私，我以为你不知道这个词是什么意思呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我可不是故意的。这两天士兵们嚷嚷着想把遗书领回去。是你自己没有写好名字，才让这封信落了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>明天一早，我会带骑兵军离开顿河，他们很多人都不会再有机会回到家乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>就此别过之前，你还有一次去骑兵军塞契的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你想让我带走那些年轻人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这不该是他们的战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭的飞行器在天空留下一道久不消散的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>他们理应见到下一个春天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">五天后</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\"><img alt=\"0xiangzineiwanshang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzineiwanshang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>位于基金会内部，无需额外提起外出申请，但又绝对保密的场所。你比我想象中更谨慎，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>消失太久总归会有人起疑，我们的时间很紧迫，伊里内伊委员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>我理解了，那就让我们长话短说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>关于你在琥珀屋实验室回收的情报——关于“灌体”实验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-527401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊里内伊：</div><div>你知道了多少？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>很遗憾，除了最基本的实验步骤外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>实验室里没有留下更多与兀尔德有关的信息。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-25"}}